OL,3,GNEWSATeenage Kicks, school anthems and
OL,4,Aa city united: Derry gears up for FAI
OL,5,ACup final
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's a song that has become as
OL,8,Fsynonymous with Derry City as the red
OL,9,Fand white stripes of the club's famous
OL,10,Fshirts.
OL,12,FAnd on Sunday, Teenage Kicks by The
OL,13,FUndertones could ring out across
OL,14,FDublin's Aviva Stadium as thousands of
OL,15,FCandystripes supporters cheer on their
OL,16,Fteam in the FAI Cup Final.
OL,18,FIn a remarkable coincidence, the band
OL,19,Fwill be performing in Dublin the night
OL,20,Fbefore Derry City take on Waterford in
OL,21,FIrish football's showpiece event.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
