OL,4,Aa city united: Derry gears up for FAI
OL,5,ACup final
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Undertones had booked their gig at
OL,8,Fthe Olympia Theatre a year in advance,
OL,9,Fas part of their 50th anniversary tour.
